        "subject": "=New Employee Onboarding IT Request: {{ $('Get a row').item.json.name }}",
        "message": "=Hi IT Support Team,\n\nI would like to request IT setup and equipment for a new employee joining our team. Here are the details:\n\nEmployee Name: {{ $('Get a row').item.json.name }}\n\nJob Title / Department: {{ $('Get a row1').item.json.department }}\n\nStart Date: [YYYY-MM-DD]\n\nWork Location: {{ $('Get a row1').item.json.department }} Department\n\nItem Name: {{ $('Get a row1').item.json.item_name }}\n\nCategory: {{ $('Get a row1').item.json.category }}\n\nDescription: {{ $('Get a row1').item.json.description }}\n\nThank you for your help!\n\nBest regards,\n123Corp inc.\nAutomation\nX123-23451-123\n",
