      "parameters": {
        "content": "“Why This Workflow Matters”\n\nAutomates new-hire IT onboarding: every employee is recorded and matched to the equipment their department needs, and IT approves each request by email. This cuts manual work and delays, keeps onboarding consistent, gives new hires what they need on day one, and leaves an auditable trail of requests and approvals.",
